trimmed chunk from freenode/#nethack:

<novas0x2a> since fruit is an anti-oxidant, shouldn't hitting a rust monster
with fruit juice cause damage?
<umopepisdn> What if you have your fruit set as pizza?
<umopepisdn> Pizza juice isn't an anti-oxidant.
<novas0x2a> tomato :) but the point is taken
<itsblah> but they call it "fruit" juice
<Neraikis> "this tastes like pizza juice"
<billnye> yes, you're naming a fruit... no matter how odd a name you choose

I'm inclined to agree with billnye on this, but it's up to the devs :) I
wasn't sure if it should be AD_DCAY or AD_ACID, but i chose AD_DCAY.
